# Development process

Follow root `AGENTS.md`. The source of truth is `docs/`. At session start, read `docs/00-discovery-status.md`.

Do not grant Review GO or Build GO. Do not write code unless `AGENTS.md` says the current phase allows it. Answer project questions from `docs/` using `.cursor/skills/ask-project/SKILL.md`. That skill does not replace `AGENTS.md`.
